    "created_at": "2016-05-23T11:53:06Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-05-23T11:53:06Z",
    "body": "This change doesn't hurt any websites. It makes the spec reflect implementation reality; nothing has changed in the world.\n\nAs @zcorpan has said, if you don't like this feature that browsers have implemented, you'll need to gather data to convince them to remove it.\n",
